        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Predict what will happen",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Time and context can locate a future event. 会 can express a prediction here, rather than a learned skill; 要 can express an intention or expected event.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "明天会下雨。",
                "pinyin": "míngtiān huì xiàyǔ 。",
                "meaning": "It will rain tomorrow.",
                "audio": "abc6cfd599eab711e7a1216d6ab167399007324408300a497cebe47c1d564e7b"
              },
              {
                "text": "我明天要去学校。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ míngtiān yào qù xuéxiào 。",
                "meaning": "I am going to school tomorrow.",
